{"symbol":"METAINFO","yahoo":"METAINFO.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"sme":null,"name":"Meta Infotech Limited","sector":"Technology","industry":"Software - Infrastructure","website":"https://www.metainfotech.com","about":"Meta Infotech Limited provides cybersecurity solutions in India. It offers secure access service edge (SASE) and zero trust security, endpoint detection and response (EDR/XDR), data security, data loss prevention (DLP), identity and access management (IAM), cloud security, web security, security information and event management (SIEM), network security and perimeter protection, IT/OT security, API security, email security, and application security solutions. The company also provides professional services for deployment and integration, managed security services (SOC, monitoring, and incident response), annual maintenance and technical support services, sustenance services, cybersecurity consulting and implementation services, resident engineers and resource deployment services, security assessments, training services, and knowledge enablement services, as well as trades in cybersecurity software products. It serves banking, capital market, NBFC, IT/ITeS, insurance, pharmaceuticals, healthcare, FMCG, manufacturing, real estate, hospitality, government, and public sector enterprises. The company was incorporated in 1998 and is headquartered in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-10-03T12:59:12+00:00","quote":{"price":79.5,"prevClose":76.67,"marketCap":150.11,"high52":157.75,"low52":53.17,"pe":13.54,"bookValue":38.82,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":18.48,"shares":1.8881,"insiders":72.08,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-07-11","2025-07-14","2025-07-15","2025-07-16","2025-07-17","2025-07-18","2025-07-21","2025-07-22","2025-07-23","2025-07-24","2025-07-25","2025-07-28","2025-07-29","2025-07-30","2025-07-31","2025-08-01","2025-08-04","2025-08-05","2025-08-06","2025-08-07","2025-08-08","2025-08-11","2025-08-12","2025-08-13","2025-08-14","2025-08-18","2025-0